### Step 5: Set Up GitHub Repository Permissions

**5.1 Configure GitHub Actions Settings**

Visit: `https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/suber-tube/settings/actions`
✓ Actions permissions:

Select: "Allow all actions and reusable workflows"
✓ Workflow permissions:

Select: "Read and write permissions"
Select: "Allow GitHub Actions to create and approve pull requests"
✓ Save


**5.2 Verify branch protection rules**

Visit: `https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/suber-tube/settings/branches`
For 'develop' branch:
✓ Require status checks to pass before merging
✓ Require code reviews before merging (at least 1)
✓ Require branches to be up to date before merging

For 'main' branch (production):
✓ All of above, plus:
✓ Require pull request reviews (at least 2)
✓ Require status checks to pass


